%% EduPules — concept pipeline (slide 7). Render with Mermaid (mermaid.live or mmdc).
flowchart LR
  A["Academic data<br/>(PostgreSQL: grades, attendance,<br/>enrollments, quizzes)"] --> B["Analytics<br/>(KPIs and trends per role)"]
  B --> C["Risk assessment<br/>(engine v2: score 0–100,<br/>4 levels, drivers, what-if)"]
